^{:go/breaks [[5 217]] :go/end 218} (go/method fpReady "fpReady: a floating-point instruction needs MXCSR at round to nearest without DAZ and FTZ (other modes: AX8).\n" ^bool [^{:tag (* CPU)} c ^{:tag (* Inst)} in]
